---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About Debbie | Professional Home Organizer | Tidy Terrain">
  <section class="phead">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="stack center">
        <span class="eyebrow">About</span>
        <h1>Organizing is my <b>happy place</b></h1>
        <p class="lede">Meet Debbie — the hands-on heart behind Tidy Terrain.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="split">
        <div class="stack rv">
          <h2>Hi, I'm <b>Debbie</b>.</h2>
          <p class="lede">I'm a California girl who has been organizing everything in sight for as long as I can remember. Closets, cabinets, junk drawers, other people's junk drawers. I can't help it.</p>
          <p class="lede">Friends started asking me to "come look" at their pantry or garage. I'd show up, and a few hours later they'd be texting me photos of the finished space for weeks. Watching someone love their home again — that's why Tidy Terrain exists.</p>
          <p class="lede">I started it with dog families in mind because I am one. Our dogs are family, and their things deserve a real home too — not a pile by the door.</p>
          <div class="btns"><a class="btn" href="/contact/">Work with me</a></div>
        </div>
        <div class="photo tall rv"><img src="/images/pantry.jpg" alt="Bright organized pantry" /></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="soft-bg">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="stack center rv" style="max-width:620px;margin-inline:auto">
        <span class="eyebrow">How I work</span>
        <h2>Three things I <b>promise</b></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="values">
        <div class="rv">
          <svg class="ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 7.78l1.06 1.06L12 21.23l7.78-7.78 1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.78Z"/></svg>
          <h4>Pretty and practical</h4>
          <p>If a system looks beautiful but doesn't fit how you live, it won't last. We build for both.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rv">
          <svg class="ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 12h4l3-9 4 18 3-9h4"/></svg>
          <h4>Dogs are family</h4>
          <p>Every plan includes space for your dog, because they live here too.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rv">
          <svg class="ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"/></svg>
          <h4>Kind, always</h4>
          <p>No shame, no lectures. Just a calm helper with a label maker.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bigcta">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Let's start with your <b>favorite problem room</b>.</h2>
      <p class="lede">Free 20-minute call. No pressure.</p>
      <a class="btn orange" href="/contact/">Book Your Free Consult</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
